      "created_at": "2013-04-13T16:27:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, that wording is a way to make it so that it doesn't hurt itself, and it usually won't hurt the villain (who likely has the most hp), so it'll usually but not always be the hero w/the highest hp. &nbsp;But there's a chance that it won't hit the hero with the most hp, so it's more interesting.</p>",
